    "en": "About us"
  },
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "zh": "清泰源實業股份有限公司（GETX MICROBIOTECH CO., LTD.）專業從事工業的微生物污染控制與管理工作，從原料的進料管理、製程的微生物污染控制、成品的防腐作業以及環境的污染管控等。",
      "en": "GETX MICROBIOTECH CO., LTD. specialises in industrial microbial contamination control and management — covering raw-material intake, in-process contamination control, finished-product preservation and environmental contamination management."
    },
    {
      "zh": "由於產業界面臨微生物不斷的污染，清泰源的主要任務為協助客戶解決因微生物污染所引起的疑難雜症，進而提昇整個工廠的運作正常化及提昇客戶製品品質，為公司努力發展的主要目標。",
      "en": "Industry faces constant microbial contamination. Our mission is to help clients solve the problems it causes, so that their plants run normally and their products reach a higher standard of quality."
    }
  ],
